            {
                "field_id": 62473,
                "field_name": "Release Note",
                "field_value": "<p>idrac_os_deployment - Role for RHEL OS deployment<br />idrac_gather_facts - Role for fetching details of different components of Server<br />idrac_server_powerstate - Role for Power state operations<br />idrac_import_server_config_profile - Role for importing Server Configuration Profile<br />idrac_certificate - Role for configuration of certificates (HTTPS, CA, CSC and Client trust certificate)<br />ome_inventory - Defect fixes: JIT-256257, JIT-256593, JIT-256589<br />Fixing of Import issues (Unused imports in the module)</p>"
            },
